Speaking of moving — in this challenge, you will become the NPC puppeteer. We task you with creating a new animation for any character besides Geralt. It could be a cool pose that goes with Photo Mode, an entire choreographed dance routine, or anything in between.

Submit your work by uploading it on Nexus Mods at https://www.nexusmods.com/witcher3 and sharing a link in the submission form on the official contest website: https://thewitcher.ly/REDkitContest. There, you will also find a set of Frequently Asked Questions to guide you.

Here are a few things to remember:
• you need to participate individually, and you can only submit one mod per challenge, but you can take part in as many challenges as you like;
• entries in this challenge can be submitted until August 27th, 15:59 CEST;
• to qualify for the contest, mods must not have been published before April 16th, 2024, 13:00 CEST;
• submitted mods can be updated until the submission phase deadline;
• challenges are judged by CD PROJEKT RED and Yigsoft team members.

If you want to know more, you can find the complete set of rules and regulations for the contest here.

Join the main category The Witcher 3 REDkit Modding Contest: https://thewitcher.ly/REDkitContest
